  "description": "Result-based typed HTTP client for consuming MOVES Suite APIs from Blazor/MAUI/any .NET. Mirrors the companion server error contract (ProblemDetails ↔ Result<DomainError>): the API serializes DomainError→ProblemDetails, this package deserializes ProblemDetails→Result<T>.Failure(DomainError). Provides IBaseApiService marker + BaseApiService verb-helpers (Get/Post/Put/Delete → Result<T>, never throws on business errors), IAccessTokenProvider + BearerTokenHandler for reusable auth. Zero ASP.NET dependency. Proprietary — requires a commercial agreement with Cayaqui.",
