  "readmeFile": "PackageReadme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.1.0 — Release inicial. Cliente HTTP tipado Result-based: marker `IBaseApiService` + `BaseApiService` (verb-helpers Get/Post/Put/Delete → `Result<T>`, nunca lanza por error de negocio), mapeo inverso ProblemDetails→`Result<DomainError>` simétrico a `Cayaqui.BuildingBlocks.AspNetCore.ProblemDetailsMapper`, `IAccessTokenProvider` + `BearerTokenHandler` para auth reutilizable (Web OBO / MAUI MSAL), DI mínimo (`AddMpsApiClientCore`, `AddMpsAccessTokenProvider`). Sin dependencia ASP.NET. Depende de Cayaqui.BuildingBlocks 0.4.0.",
